{"slug":"03-team-sicherheit","language":"deu","text":"Bei WTN war ich nicht nur Azubi, sondern direkt Teil vom Team. Wir bilden nicht aus, um sie danach auf die Straße zu setzen. Es ist ein absolut sicherer Ausbildungsberuf aus dem Grund. Es erklären sich immer weniger Menschen, was Handwerkliches zu machen und vor allem auch, sich die Vielfalt anzunehmen an Technologien, die Vielfalt an Wissen anzueignen. Also die Ausbildung bei WTN, ich hab sie selber durchlebt. Sie macht Spaß, weil wir einen sehr, sehr hohen Maschinenpark haben, wo man sehr, sehr viele Technologien anders wie bei anderen Unternehmen mitbekommt und dadurch auch sehr, sehr viel Wissen mitnimmt. Die Zukunft von WTN sind gute Auszubildende und aus diesem Grund bieten wir 'n sicherer Arbeitsplatz. Dreißig Jahre, achtundfünfzig Ausbildungen und der nächste Platz, der wartet auf dich.","words":[{"w":"Bei","s":0.52,"e":0.62},{"w":"WTN","s":0.68,"e":1.1},{"w":"war","s":1.24,"e":1.38},{"w":"ich","s":1.4,"e":1.46},{"w":"nicht","s":1.52,"e":1.64},{"w":"nur","s":1.68,"e":1.76},{"w":"Azubi,","s":1.8,"e":2.26},{"w":"sondern","s":2.56,"e":2.78},{"w":"direkt","s":2.8,"e":3.06},{"w":"Teil","s":3.1,"e":3.3},{"w":"vom","s":3.34,"e":3.46},{"w":"Team.","s":3.52,"e":3.74},{"w":"Wir","s":6.46,"e":6.64},{"w":"bilden","s":6.7,"e":7.08},{"w":"nicht","s":7.14,"e":7.4},{"w":"aus,","s":7.62,"e":7.9},{"w":"um","s":8.1,"e":8.18},{"w":"sie","s":8.24,"e":8.34},{"w":"danach","s":8.42,"e":8.74},{"w":"auf","s":8.78,"e":8.88},{"w":"die","s":8.9,"e":9},{"w":"Straße","s":9.04,"e":9.42},{"w":"zu","s":9.54,"e":9.64},{"w":"setzen.","s":9.68,"e":10.12},{"w":"Es","s":12.52,"e":12.7},{"w":"ist","s":12.76,"e":12.84},{"w":"ein","s":12.84,"e":12.92},{"w":"absolut","s":12.98,"e":13.36},{"w":"sicherer","s":13.42,"e":13.68},{"w":"Ausbildungsberuf","s":13.76,"e":14.62},{"w":"aus","s":14.66,"e":14.8},{"w":"dem","s":14.86,"e":15.02},{"w":"Grund.","s":15.08,"e":15.48},{"w":"Es","s":15.54,"e":15.68},{"w":"erklären","s":15.74,"e":16},{"w":"sich","s":16.